[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":100},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_43":44,"_45":-5,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":61},"expiresAt",1794530490000,"id","p3l7vk5l199h68wksyf6etvvm","title","Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞 CVE-2026-98432 已复现","originalTitle","【已复现】Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞(CVE-2026-98432)安全风险通告第二次更新","summary","奇安信 CERT 已复现 Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞 CVE-2026-98432，该漏洞源于 IPv4 TCP 握手处理竞态，可通过网络触发内核内存损坏、绕过 KASLR 的信息泄露、拒绝服务，并在特定 MPTCP 监听条件下实现远程任意代码执行和获取 root 权限。","reason","通告给出漏洞原理、受影响内核分支与修复版本，并补充复现、临时缓解和攻击迹象排查方法，便于运维人员核对暴露面并推进升级。","source",{"_73":99},"links",{"_83":98},"publishedAt","2026-11-03T09:44:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-03T12:10:19.884Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97],"score",84,"selected",true,"channel","news","story",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"x","readingMode","full","author","body",{"_61":82,"_83":-5,"_84":83,"_85":37},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[78],"topics",[68,69,70],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group",{"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67},"hasTranslation",false,"bodyLanguage","zh","factId","fSxKTnSe_Y0I","reportCount",1,"additionalSourceCount",0,{"_71":76,"_73":77},{"_71":31,"_73":75},{"_71":72,"_73":74},"slug","research","name","技术研究","漏洞披露","kernel","内核与系统",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"publicId","931527cd-d2c1-46c8-98e1-79c4b2388dfe","Linux TCP竞态漏洞已修复，RCE仍依赖MPTCP","<p><span>奇安信 CERT</span> <span>2026-11-03 17:44</span> <span>北京</span></p><p><img src=\"/dailyinfo/media/1718b0648370dd6b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。</p><p><span><span>●&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>点击↑蓝字关注我们，获取更多安全风险通告</span></span></p><hr><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><p><span><strong><span><span>漏洞概述</span></span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>漏洞名称</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" align=\"left\"><p><span><span>Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span><strong><span>漏洞编号</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" align=\"left\"><p><span><span>QVD-2026-85969</span><span>，</span><span>CVE-2026-98432</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><strong><span><span>公开时间</span></span></strong></span></strong></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span>2026-10-15</span></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><strong><span><span>影响量级</span></span></strong></span></strong></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span>百万级</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>奇安信评级</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>高危</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><span>CVSS 3.1分数</span></span></strong></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span><strong><span>9.8</span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span>威胁类型</span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span><span>代码执行、权限提升</span></span></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><span>利用可能性</span></span></strong></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><strong><span>高</span></strong></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>POC状态</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>已公开</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>在野利用状态</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><span><span>未发现</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>EXP状态</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span><span>未公开</span></span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span>技术细节状态</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p><span><strong><span><span><span>已公开</span></span></span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"4\" align=\"left\"><p><strong><span><span>危害描述：</span></span></strong><span><span>攻击者可利用该漏洞通过网络触发内核内存损坏、信息泄露（绕过 KASLR）、拒绝服务，或在特定条件下（如 MPTCP 监听器）实现远程任意代码执行并获取 root 权限。</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>漏洞详情</span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>影响组件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>Linux 内核是一款开源的类 Unix 操作系统内核，是绝大多数 Linux 发行版的底层核心基础组件。内核负责管理系统硬件资源，实现进程调度、内存管理、文件系统、信号与定时器、设备驱动等核心基础能力。它为上层用户态程序提供系统调用接口，支撑应用程序运行，广泛部署在服务器、云容器、嵌入式设备以及 Android 移动终端当中。POSIX 定时器是内核提供给应用层的标准定时器接口，支持按线程 CPU 时间触发定时事件，供多线程业务程序使用。</span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>漏洞描述</span></span></strong></p><p><span>近日，奇安信CERT监测到官方修复<span>Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞(CVE-2026-98432)</span>，该漏洞源于 IPv4 TCP 握手处理中的竞态条件：tcp_v4_syn_recv_sock() 将请求套接字的 ireq-&gt;ireq_opt（IP 选项结构）所有权直接转移给子套接字的 inet_opt 而未复制，且未清除原指针。自 commit 079096f103fa 起，请求套接字无需持有监听锁即可处理，允许另一 CPU 并发处理重传 SYN 并通过 tcp_check_req() 构建 SYNACK。子套接字在 inet_sock_destruct() 中以普通 kfree() 释放 inet_opt，导致 ip_options_build() 中发生释放后重用。攻击者可利用该漏洞通过网络触发内核内存损坏、信息泄露（绕过 KASLR）、拒绝服务，或在特定条件下（如 MPTCP 监听器）实现远程任意代码执行并获取 root 权限。<span>目前该漏洞PoC和技术细节已公开。</span></span><span><span>鉴于已有较可信来源称已发现对于此漏洞的扫描探测行为，建议客户立即开展资产排查，尽快完成内核升级与暴露面收敛。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>本次更新内容：&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>新增复现截图；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>新增临时解决方案；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>新增攻击检测与迹象排查。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>利用条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1. 目标为受影响版本 Linux 内核并对外提供 TCP 服务（服务器、云主机、容器宿主、嵌入式与 Android 设备均适用）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 远程利用要求目标存在 MPTCP 监听（或 Go 1.24 及以上默认启用 MPTCP 的监听程序），且握手报文可携带 IPv4 选项；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 本地或同网段攻击者可自行构造带 IP 选项的握手报文，无需任何凭据与用户交互；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 若启用 tcp_migrate_req 或存在 BPF reuseport 迁移程序，第二条路径可将利用面扩大至普通 IPv4 监听；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 利用失败通常仅表现为握手异常或内核 oops/panic，攻击者可反复重试。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>影响范围</span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>影响版本</span></span></strong></p><p><span>Linux 内核 4.4 及之后版本（引入提交 079096f103fa），直至各分支修复版本：5.10.272、5.15.223、6.1.190、6.6.159、6.12.113、6.18.56、7.2.10、7.3。4.4/4.9/4.14/4.19/5.4 等已停止维护分支需依赖发行版或商业支持回移。<span>具体影响版本如下：</span></span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 5.10.* &lt; 5.10.272</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 5.15.* &lt; 5.15.223</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.1.* &lt; 6.1.190</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.6.* &lt; 6.6.159</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.12.* &lt; 6.12.113</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.18.* &lt; 6.18.56</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 7.2.* &lt; 7.2.10</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 7.3-rc &lt; 7.3-rc7</span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>其他受影响组件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>MPTCP 监听套接字；Go 1.24 及以上默认启用 MPTCP 的监听程序。IPv6 不受第一条路径影响（tcp_v6_syn_recv_sock 会复制选项），但 tcp_v6_reqsk_destructor 存在同类迁移缺陷（ipv6_opt，仅 CALIPSO 场景），将由独立补丁修复。</span></p><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>复现情况</span></strong></p><p><span><span>目前，奇安信CERT已成功复现<span>Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP 释放后重用漏洞(CVE-2026-98432)触发UAF，导致内存破坏</span>，截图如下：</span></span></p><p><img src=\"/dailyinfo/media/894ddc1d62f974be.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>处置建议</span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>安全更新</span></span></strong></p><p><span>官方已于 2026 年 10 月 15 日在各受支持的稳定分支发布修复，建议尽快将 Linux 内核升级至以下版本：</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 5.10.* &gt;= 5.10.272</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 5.15.* &gt;= 5.15.223</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.1.* &gt;= 6.1.190</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.6.* &gt;= 6.6.159</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.12.* &gt;= 6.12.113</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 6.18.* &gt;= 6.18.56</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 7.2.* &gt;= 7.2.10</span></p><p><span>Linux Kernel 7.3.*（7.3 及后续主线版本已包含修复）</span></p><p><span>修复要点：将 net/ipv4/af_inet.c 中 inet_sock_destruct() 与 net/ipv4/tcp_ipv4.c 中 tcp_v4_reqsk_destructor() 的 kfree() 改为 kfree_rcu(..., rcu)，使选项对象在 RCU 宽限期结束后再归还内存（上游提交 e3f33b0a1d89，作者 Eric Dumazet，共改动 2 行）。</span></p><p><span>发行版进展（截至 2026 年 10 月 29 日）：Debian 12、13 与 unstable 已分别以 6.1.190-1、6.12.113-1、7.2.13-1 修复；Amazon Linux 2023 的 kernel6.12 与 kernel6.18 已修复、主 kernel 包待发布；Ubuntu（20.04–26.10）与 RHEL 仍处于修复流程中，评级分别为 High 与 Important，请以厂商安全公告及 CVE 跟踪页面为准。Android 设备需等待 Google、SoC 与 ODM 厂商的安全补丁，请关注月度安全公告。云主机镜像使用独立内核包（如 linux-image-aws/azure/gcp），修复可能滞后于通用内核，请分别核查。</span></p><p><span>补丁下载地址：</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e3f33b0a1d89d738e2b913dab519226eaf76e15b\">https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e3f33b0a1d89d738e2b913dab519226eaf76e15b</a></span></p><p><span><span>临时解决方案：</span></span></p><p><span>在无法立即升级时，可采取以下措施降低风险，但不能替代补丁：</span></p><ul><li><p><span>1.关闭 MPTCP：sysctl -w net.mptcp.enabled=0；Go 程序可设置环境变量 GODEBUG=multipathtcp=0，或在 main 模块 go.mod 中加入 godebug multipathtcp=0，或改用 net.ListenConfig.SetMultipathTCP(false)；</span></p></li><li><p><span>2.执行 sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_migrate_req=0，并用 bpftool prog list 排查、移除 sk_reuseport 类型的 BPF 迁移程序，以关闭第二条路径；</span></p></li><li><p><span>3.清理不必要的 setsockopt(IP_OPTIONS) 用法，并在边界设备上评估丢弃携带 IP 选项的 SYN 报文（部分网络设备与中间盒会主动添加 IP 选项，需先做业务验证）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>4.收敛暴露面：对非必要对外开放的 TCP 服务实施访问控制，优先保护 Web、SSH、数据库与代理等互联网可达服务。</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>攻击检测与迹象排查</span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>网络侧</span></span></strong></p><ul></ul><pre><code><span><span># 统计带 IP 选项的入站 TCP（nftables 计数器）</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>nft</span>&nbsp;list table inet cve_2026_98432</span></code><br><code><span><span># 抓包看 SYN 是否带 IP 选项（ihl &gt; 5）</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>tcpdump</span>&nbsp;-ni any 'tcp[tcpflags] &amp; tcp-syn !=&nbsp;<span>0</span>&nbsp;and ip[<span>0</span>] &amp;&nbsp;<span>0</span>x0f &gt;&nbsp;<span>5</span>'</span></code><br><code><span><span># 看 MPTCP 连接</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>ss</span>&nbsp;-M</span></code><br></pre><ul><li><p><span>重点看同一源 IP 对同一目标端口的高频重传 SYN（竞态尝试特征）。</span></p></li><li><p><span>关注 MPTCP 选项（MP_CAPABLE / MP_JOIN）的异常 SYN。</span></p></li><li><p><span>若使用 nftables 规则，counter 增长即为可疑流量。</span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>主机侧</span></span></strong></p><ul></ul><pre><code><span><span># 内核版本</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>uname</span>&nbsp;-r</span></code><br><code><span><span># 是否在受影响范围（对照修复版本表）</span></span></code><br><code><span><span># 看内核日志中的 UAF / KASAN / oops</span></span></code><br><code><span>dmesg | grep -iE&nbsp;<span>\"use-after-free|KASAN|ip_options|inet_csk_route_req\"</span></span></code><br><code><span><span># 看 MPTCP 是否启用</span></span></code><br><code><span>sysctl net.mptcp.enabled</span></code><br><code><span><span>cat</span>&nbsp;/proc/sys/net/mptcp/enabled</span></code><br><code><span><span># Go 服务是否启用 MPTCP（1.24+ 默认）</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>tr</span>&nbsp;<span>'\\0'</span>&nbsp;<span>'\\n'</span>&nbsp;&lt; /proc/&lt;pid&gt;/environ | grep GODEBUG</span></code><br></pre><p><span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>&gt;</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>核查脚本</span></span></strong></p><ul></ul><pre><code><span><span>#!/bin/bash</span></span></code><br><code><span>k=$(<span>uname</span>&nbsp;-r)</span></code><br><code><span><span>echo</span>&nbsp;<span>\"kernel:&nbsp;</span><span><span>$k</span></span><span>\"</span></span></code><br><code><span><span>case</span>&nbsp;<span>\"</span><span><span>$k</span></span><span>\"</span>&nbsp;<span>in</span></span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 5.10.*) [[&nbsp;<span>${k#5.10.}</span>&nbsp;-ge 272 ]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 5.15.*) [[&nbsp;<span>${k#5.15.}</span>&nbsp;-ge 223 ]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 6.1.*) &nbsp;[[&nbsp;<span>${k#6.1.}</span>&nbsp; -ge 190 ]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 6.6.*) &nbsp;[[&nbsp;<span>${k#6.6.}</span>&nbsp; -ge 159 ]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 6.12.*) [[&nbsp;<span>${k#6.12.}</span>&nbsp;-ge 113 ]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; 6.18.*) [[&nbsp;<span>${k#6.18.}</span>&nbsp;-ge 56 &nbsp;]] &amp;&amp;&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;OK ||&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;VULN ;;</span></code><br><code><span>&nbsp; *)&nbsp;<span>echo</span>&nbsp;<span>\"请对照发行版公告\"</span>&nbsp;;;</span></code><br><code><span><span>esac</span></span></code><br></pre><p><span>注意：发行版内核版本号（如 4.18.0-553.182.1.el8_10）不能直接用上游版本判断，需查发行版 errata。</span></p><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><span><span>[1]<a href=\"https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e3f33b0a1d89d738e2b913dab519226eaf76e15b\">https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e3f33b0a1d89d738e2b913dab519226eaf76e15b</a></span></span></p><p><span><span>[2]</span><span><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/discovering-vulnerabilities-with-claude\">https://www.anthropic.com/research/discovering-vulnerabilities-with-claude</a></span></span></p><p><span><span>[3]</span><span><a href=\"https://x.com/MalwareTechBlog/status/2117508092321747077\">https://x.com/MalwareTechBlog/status/2117508092321747077</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><p><span><span>2026年10月30日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026年11月03日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告第二次更新。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>漏洞情报服务</span></strong></p><p><span><span>「</span><span>奇安信漏洞情报平台</span><span>」</span><span>重磅上线，诚邀您来体验：</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"图片\" src=\"/dailyinfo/media/1f052dd34c0f729e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img alt=\"图片\" src=\"/dailyinfo/media/2d3968c80bcb1a29.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img alt=\"图片\" title=\"CERT LOGO.png\" width=\"100%\" src=\"/dailyinfo/media/342f5c984a25495b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><span><strong><span>奇安信 CERT</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>致力于</span></span></strong><span><span>第一时间为企业级用户提供</span><strong><span><span>权威</span></span></strong><span>漏洞情报和</span></span><strong><span><span>有效</span></span></strong><span><span>解决方案。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>点击↓</span><strong><span><span>阅读原文</span></span></strong><span>，到</span></span><strong><span><span>ALPHA威胁分析平台</span></span></strong><span><span>订阅更多漏洞信息。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://ti.qianxin.com/portal/subscription\">阅读原文</a></p><p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.xlab.app/link-proxy/?k=9a46d271&amp;r=1&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzU5NDgxODU1MQ%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247507998%26idx%3D1%26sn%3Dbe5814f110096f1e65ec30a7a35c573f\">跳转微信打开</a></p>","original","zhKind","complete","漏洞","复现","漏洞分析","补丁","内核","漏洞利用","奇安信","Debian","AWS","Ubuntu","Red Hat","Google","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247507998&idx=1&sn=be5814f110096f1e65ec30a7a35c573f","奇安信 CERT",{"_101":102,"_103":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
